# INVWINHE.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: F1 in the
# dialogs of no screen of their own.  Export CSV's file name dialog and
# form show EXPORT, Import CSV's IMPORT; the dialog and the preview of
# the loans report, the last of the reports, show REPORTS, those of the
# item labels, the first of the labels, LABELS.  ESC closes each help,
# then its dialog, and F1 on the item list then shows ITEMS again.  The
# end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINHE.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A E F1
S EXPNAME
K ESC
T he.csv
K ENTER F1
S EXPORT
K ESC ESC ALT-A M F1
S IMPNAME
K ESC
T impmix.csv
K ENTER F1
S IMPORT
K ESC ESC ALT-R L F1
S REPORTS
K ESC TAB TAB
T S
K ENTER F1
S RPTVIEW
K ESC ESC ESC ALT-R T F1
S LABELS
K ESC ALT-O
T S
K ENTER F1
S LBLVIEW
K ESC ESC ESC F1
S ITEMS
K ESC ALT-F X
